Provides: i3lock
Conflicts: i3lock
Replaces: i3lock
Description: improved screen locker with colour and blur support
 i3lock-color is a fork of the i3lock screen locker that makes every element
 of the unlock indicator configurable. It is a drop-in replacement for i3lock
 and installs the same i3lock binary, manual page and PAM configuration, so it
 cannot be co-installed with the i3lock package from the distribution archive.
 .
 On top of upstream i3lock it adds:
 .
  * arbitrary colours for every ring, text and background element, including
    separate colours for the input, verifying, wrong and idle states;
  * a blurred screenshot of the desktop as the lock background;
  * configurable indicator geometry, radius and ring width;
  * custom text, fonts and time/date display with strftime formats;
  * a bar indicator mode as an alternative to the ring.
 .
 It uses PAM and is therefore compatible with LDAP and other PAM backends.
